            "end": 1686,
            "start": 1295,
            "type": "TextPositionSelector"
          },
          {
            "exact": " Much evil have the self-proclaimed servants of God done in their time, thanks to the teaching which they called Theology, but the servants of the people, thanks to the teaching which they call Science, if they have done less evil it is only because they have not yet had time to do it, but already on their conscience there lie rivers of blood and great divisions and exasperation among men",
